# Curated AppStore extras (not in blackmatrix7's AppStore.list).
# The daily sync appends these to the upstream list when building rule/*/AppStore/AppStore.list.
# Upstream has only apps.apple.com + itunes.apple.com; App Store downloads/icons
# go via mzstatic.com, iosapps/osxapps.itunes.apple.com and Apple CDNs.
# Narrow Apple-only domains. Never add apple.com (too broad: iCloud, Music, etc.).
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mzstatic.com
DOMAIN,iosapps.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,osxapps.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appstore.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appsto.re
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cdn-apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appldnld.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,secure-appldnld.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aaplimg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.com.cn
